    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kqwnl03",
      "content": "Chhattisgarh is a landlocked state located in central India. It is bounded by Madhya Pradesh to the north and northwest, Uttar Pradesh and Jharkhand to the northeast, Odisha to the east, Andhra Pradesh and Telangana to the south, and Maharashtra to the southwest."
