      "content": "2.5 Climate"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "z4syao6",
      "content": "Chhattisgarh has a tropical monsoon climate with three distinct seasons: summer (March to June), monsoon (July to October), and winter (November to February)."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
